os","id":16049401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDQ5NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16049401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos","html_url":"https://github.com/vrravalos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vrravalos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T23:14:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T23:15:21Z","body":"Hi @Eagle6393 , not sure if this helps your investigation, but in my experience, forcing a clean start by removing the .godot folder has resolved similar strange behaviors after upgrades (on my case). It might be worth a try, hope it helps!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3826345413/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865461427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115599#issuecomment-3865461427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115599","id":3865461427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mZkKz","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T21:02:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T21:02:49Z","body":"Hello, and thanks for the recent fixes 🙏\n\nI noticed that a Godot 4.6.1 Release Candidate has been released, so I tested my project with it.\n\nThe main issue with the sky/environment shader that was present in 4.6.0 is mostly resolved, which is great — the lighting and overall look are much closer to what I had in 4.5.\n\nHowever, after updating to 4.6.1 RC, I started noticing visible banding / separating lines in the sky. These lines were not present in 4.5, and they are more noticeable in 4.6.1 RC than in 4.6.0.\n\nI’ve attached screenshots for comparison.\n\nCould you please clarify whether:\n\nthis is a known remaining issue with the built-in sky/environment shaders, or\n\nit could be related to something specific in my setup/shader usage?\n\nAnd is this expected to be addressed further before the 4.6.1 stable release?\n\nThanks again for your work and for looking into this.\n\n<img width=\"857\" height=\"529\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dd560b8-ddef-4120-8c05-406d502130ca\" />\n<img width=\"864\" height=\"509\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50fe1bb2-a12e-4cf5-be2b-a902eacf0f96\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865461427/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]